---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Fang & Forge Productions">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">About Fang & Forge</div>
      <h1>We are building a home for our worlds and the tools used to explore them.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Fang & Forge Productions is an independent creative studio focused on worldbuilding,
        storytelling, tabletop gaming, and digital tools.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container copy">
      <h2>What we're doing</h2>
      <p>
        Our goal is to develop original worlds and projects under one studio while allowing each
        world to grow into its own identity. The site will evolve alongside those projects rather
        than being limited to a single campaign or game.
      </p>

      <h2>Where we're starting</h2>
      <p>
        Veyra is the first world being brought into the Fang & Forge platform. At the same time,
        we are developing tabletop and virtual tabletop projects that can support our games and
        future creative work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
